## Stack

| Layer | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Contracts | Solidity 0.8.26, Foundry | Fuzz tests on the attenuation invariant |
| Chain | Sepolia | ENSv2 beta is Sepolia-only |
| Naming | ENSv2 — hierarchical registries, EAC, Permissioned Resolvers | Required by the ENS track |
| ENS tooling | `ens-cli` | Handles subregistry deploy/set calldata. Don't hand-roll |
| Hardware root | Ledger Key Ring CLI (`wallet-cli ring`) | Mandatory for Ledger eligibility |
| Signing | EIP-712 | What the device renders legibly |
| Agent runtime | TypeScript, Node 20 | Matches Graph and Ledger tooling |
| Data | Subgraph MCP + Subgraph Studio key | Live data required, mocks disqualify |
| Triggers | Substreams gRPC subscription | Polling is a bug when the guard spends money |
| Payments | x402 | Budget unit; both Graph and Ledger name it |
| Distribution | MCP server + `SKILL.md` | Graph rewards reusable infra over apps |
| Web | Next.js + viem + force-directed tree | One screen only |

**Deliberately excluded:** no ERC-4337, no ERC-7710, no database, no auth service. Every one of those is a layer competing projects used and we replace.

