## Demo script — 90 seconds

Open with the **block**, not the tree forming.

| Time | Beat |
|---|---|
| 0:00–0:20 | A sub-agent attempts an action outside its scope. Contract refuses. Red flash, revert reason `SCOPE_WIDENED` on screen. |
| 0:20–0:45 | Root mandate approved on the physical Ledger. Tree forms: subregistries deployed, subnames minted with visibly narrowing scope. |
| 0:45–1:10 | The agent detects liquidation risk from live Graph data and acts inside its budget, paying for its own queries via x402. Real money, real position. |
| 1:10–1:30 | Revoke the root from a second terminal. Entire subtree greys out mid-execution, one transaction. |

Split-screen: tree on the left, real transactions scrolling on the right, physical device on camera.

