## Demo video — hard technical rules

Between 2 and 4 minutes. Uploads outside that range are automatically rejected.

**Automatic re-submission triggers — any one of these and we are asked to redo it:**

| ❌ Do not | Note |
|---|---|
| Export below 720p | Upload fails outright |
| Exceed 4 minutes | Upload fails outright |
| Speed up the video to fit | — |
| Use music + on-screen text instead of talking | — |
| Record on a mobile phone | — |
| Use text-to-speech or an AI voiceover | **A human must narrate** |

**Also:** keep the intro under 20 seconds, speak slowly, avoid background noise and echo, edit out waiting time, and no more than 4 bullet points per slide.

### Video plan — 3:30 target

| Time | Beat |
|---|---|
| 0:00–0:20 | The problem, spoken. Under 20 seconds. |
| 0:20–0:50 | **Lead with the block.** Sub-agent attempts to exceed scope, contract refuses, `SCOPE_WIDENED` on screen. |
| 0:50–1:30 | Root mandate signed on the physical device. Tree forms, scope visibly narrowing. |
| 1:30–2:10 | Agent detects liquidation risk from live Graph data and acts inside budget, paying x402 for its own queries. |
| 2:10–2:40 | Device counterfactual: same escalation with the device unplugged. It hangs. |
| 2:40–3:10 | Revoke the root. Entire subtree dies mid-execution, one transaction. |
| 3:10–3:30 | Metrics table on screen: 12/12 blocked, gas, revocation latency, Substreams vs polling. |

Cut the waiting. Edit out every pending transaction.

---

## Risks

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| **Theatre delegation** — sub-agents are function calls with names attached | Permissions must be read from the resolver and enforced in-contract. This is the one thing that loses all three tracks. |
| No physical Ledger device | Verify Speculos/emulator path on day 1. If it fails, Ledger is dead and Hedera replaces it. |
| ENSv2 subregistry friction | Subregistry must be deployed and set before any subname exists. Use `ens-cli`, don't hand-roll calldata. |
| Graph leg stays generic | The x402 budget link is mandatory, not optional. Without it this track is lost. |
| Scope creep | Feature freeze end of Fri 12 Sep. A shipped 7.5 beats an unbuilt 9. |
| **Wrong deadline in someone's head** | It is **Sep 13, not Sep 16**. Sep 16 is when judging ends. Tell all three people today. |
| **AI attribution missing** | Submissions relying entirely on AI may be ineligible for partner prizes. `AI-USE.md` + committed `SPEC.md` and `prompts/` + real authored commits from each person. |
| **Video rejected on a technicality** | 720p minimum, under 4:00, human voice, not phone-recorded. Any one of these forces a re-submission. Record Friday, not Sunday. |
| Own subgraph slips | Deploy a minimal schema on day 4 indexing only Granted and Revoked. Extend later. An indexed subgraph beats a perfect unindexed one. |
| Remote enrollment blocked by Key Ring transport | Fall back to a signed-approval relay and document the blocker in FEEDBACK.md. A documented failure still scores on DX. |
| Landing page eats a day | Day 6 only, after the demo works. It is the most fun thing to build and the least scored. |

